async function exportCSV(){const rows=[['标题','类型','分类','来源','状态','作者']];for(let offset=0;;offset+=100){const data=await api('/admin/items?limit=100&offset='+offset);for(const raw of data.items){const i=normalizeItem(raw);rows.push([i.title,TYPES[i.type],i.category,sourceById(i.source)?.name||'',i.status,i.author])}if(offset+data.items.length>=data.total||!data.items.length)break;if(offset>=9900){toast('本次导出前 10,000 份资料。更大规模请从数据库导出。');break}}const safeCell=x=>{let s=String(x);if(/^[=+@\-\t\r]/.test(s))s="'"+s;return '"'+s.replace(/"/g,'""')+'"'};const csv='\ufeff'+rows.map(r=>r.map(safeCell).join(',')).join('\r\n');const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csv],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='知序-学习资料清单.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);toast('真实资料清单已导出')}

